message.content:
{
  "description": "The creature is shown in right-facing profile against a plain light background, standing on all four limbs with its body arched. It is a stout, quadrupedal mammal with an elongated tapering snout, a long thick tail resting on the ground behind it, and a body mostly covered in overlapping dark brown to gray-brown keratinous scales. Large irregular patches of pale pink, wrinkled, bare skin interrupt the scaly covering on the mid-back, the mid-flank, and the lower rear flank. The underbelly and inner portions of the limbs are pale beige skin with sparse scaling. The head is narrow with a small dark eye and a rounded ear, the limbs are short and muscular ending in large curved claws with dark soil around the feet, and the tail is long, tapering, and scaly.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "elongated and narrow with a blunt, rounded snout bearing a dark nostril at the tip, small dark glossy eye with fine wrinkles around it, and a few short whiskers near the mouth; dorsal surface from forehead to nose covered in small overlapping dark scales, ventral and lateral surfaces are textured gray-brown skin",
      "where": "at the front right end of the body, extending forward from the neck"
    },
    {
      "part": "ears",
      "looks_like": "one small rounded external ear with a slightly curled outer rim and fine short hairs around the margin, gray-brown skin with a visible ear canal",
      "where": "on the side of the head just behind and slightly below the scaled crown, behind the eye"
    },
    {
      "part": "eyes",
      "looks_like": "one small round dark eye with a glossy highlight and a wrinkled eyelid",
      "where": "on the side of the head, below the scaly covering and in front of the ear"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four short stout muscular limbs, outer surfaces covered in overlapping dark fan-shaped scales, inner and lower surfaces pale beige to pinkish bare skin with some dark dirt speckling; forelimbs are positioned under the chest, hindlimbs under the rear body",
      "where": "two forelimbs extending down from the front torso and two hindlimbs extending down from the rear torso to the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "four broad feet each with five digits ending in long thick dark brown to black curved claws; the skin of the feet and lower legs is pale with clinging dark soil particles",
      "where": "at the bottom of each leg, in contact with the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "long thick at the base and tapering to a pointed tip, covered on dorsal and lateral surfaces with overlapping dark scales showing fine radial striations, ventral surface less visible",
      "where": "extending horizontally backward from the rear of the body, resting on the ground behind the hind feet"
    },
    {
      "part": "scales",
      "looks_like": "overlapping keratinous plates, fan-shaped to rounded with a darker center and lighter brown-gray edge and fine radiating lines, arranged in rows like shingles",
      "where": "covering most of the dorsal body, top of head and snout, outer limbs, and tail, except where interrupted by bare skin patches"
    },
    {
      "part": "skin and markings",
      "looks_like": "large irregular patches of pale pink, fleshy, slightly wrinkled bare skin with no scales, plus pale beige skin on the underbelly and inner limbs",
      "where": "one large patch on the mid-back, one medium patch on the mid-flank above the forelimb, and a smaller patch on the lower rear flank above the hindlimb; pale skin also on the throat, belly, and inner leg surfaces"
    }
  ],
  "attached_objects": [],
  "animals": ["pangolin"],
  "separate_bodies": 1,
  "heads": 1,
  "walking_legs": 4,
  "wings": 0,
  "extra_limb_pieces": 0,
  "tails": 1
}
